<span id="Additional_tools"></span>
===附加工具===

* [[File:Std_Recompute.svg|32px]] [[Std_Recompute|Recompute]]: Recomputes the document or selected objects.

* [[File:Std_LinkMakeGroup.svg|32px]] [[Std_LinkMakeGroup|Link Group]]: Creates a group of links.

* [[File:Std_TreeSelectAllInstances.svg|32px]] [[Std_TreeSelectAllInstances|选择所有实例]]: 选择[[Tree_View|树视图]]中对象的所有实例。

* [[File:Std_ToggleFreeze.svg|32px]] [[Std_ToggleFreeze|切换冻结]]: 切换对象的冻结状态。 {{Version|1.0}}

* [[Image:Part_SelectFilter.svg|x32px]][[Image:Toolbar_flyout_arrow_blue_background.svg|x32px]] [[Part_SelectFilter|选择过滤器]]: {{Version|1.0}}

:* [[Image:Vertex-selection.svg|32px]] [[Part_SelectFilter#Vertex_Selection|顶点选择]]: 只有顶点可被选中。

:* [[Image:Edge-selection.svg|32px]] [[Part_SelectFilter#Edge_Selection|边选择]]: 只有边可被选中。

:* [[Image:Face-selection.svg|32px]] [[Part_SelectFilter#Face_Selection|面选择]]: 只有面可被选中。

:* [[Image:Clear-selection.svg|32px]] [[Part_SelectFilter#No_Selection_Filters|无选择过滤器]]: 所有子元素都可被选中。

* [[Std_Expressions|表达式操作]]:

:* [[Std_Expressions#Copy_Selected|复制选中项]]: 从选中的对象复制表达式数据到剪贴板。

:* [[Std_Expressions#Copy_Active_Document|复制活动文档]]: 从活动文档复制表达式数据到剪贴板。

:* [[Std_Expressions#Copy_All_Documents|复制所有文档]]: 从所有文档复制表达式数据到剪贴板。

:* [[Std_Expressions#Paste|粘贴]]: 从剪贴板粘贴表达式数据。

<span id="Obsolete_tools"></span>
===废弃工具===

* [[Image:Std_MeasureDistance.svg|32px]] [[Std_MeasureDistance|Measure distance]]: Creates an object to measure and display a distance. Not available in {{VersionPlus|1.0}}. Use [[Std Measure|Std Measure]] instead.

* [[Image:View_Measure_Clear_All.svg|32px]] [[View_Measure_Clear_All|Clear measurement]]: Clears [[Part_Workbench|Part]]  measurements. Not available in {{VersionPlus|1.0}}. Use [[Std Measure|Std Measure]] instead.

* [[Image:View_Measure_Toggle_All.svg|32px]] [[View_Measure_Toggle_All|Toggle measurement]]: Toggles the display of Part measurements. Not available in {{VersionPlus|1.0}}. Use [[Std Measure|Std Measure]] instead.

* [[File:Std_FreeCADFAQ.svg|32px]] [[Std_FreeCADFAQ|FreeCAD FAQ]]: 打开FreeCAD FAQ wiki页面. {{VersionPlus|1.1}}中不可用。

* [[File:Std_FreeCADPowerUserHub.svg|32px]] [[Std_FreeCADPowerUserHub|Python scripting documentation]]: Opens the FreeCAD Power users documentation wiki page. Not available in {{VersionPlus|1.1}}.

* [[File:Std_OnlineHelp.svg|32px]] [[Std_OnlineHelp|Help]]: Opens the help documentation. Not available in {{VersionPlus|1.1}}.

* [[File:Std_MacroStopRecord.svg|32px]] [[Std_MacroStopRecord|Stop macro recording]]: Stops a macro recording session. Integrated in [[Std_DlgMacroRecord|Std DlgMacroRecord]]. Not available in {{VersionPlus|1.0}}.

* [[File:Std_MacroStartDebug.svg|32px]] [[Std_MacroStartDebug|Debug Macro]]: Starts a debugging session for the macro in the Macro editor. Not available in {{VersionPlus|26.3}}.

* [[File:Std_MacroStopDebug.svg|32px]] [[Std_MacroStopDebug|Stop Debugging]]: Stops a debugging session. Not available in {{VersionPlus|26.3}}.

* [[Std_MacroStepOver|Step Over]]: Steps over code. Not available in {{VersionPlus|26.3}}.

* [[Std_MacroStepInto|Step Into]]: Steps into code. Not available in {{VersionPlus|26.3}}.

* [[Std_ToggleBreakpoint|Toggle Breakpoint]]: Toggles a breakpoint. Not available in {{VersionPlus|26.3}}.

* [[Image:Std_ViewIvStereoRedGreen.svg|32px]] [[Std_ViewIvStereoRedGreen|Stereo Red/Cyan]]: Switches to red/cyan stereo view. Not available in {{VersionPlus|26.3}}.

* [[Image:Std_ViewIvStereoQuadBuff.svg|32px]] [[Std_ViewIvStereoQuadBuff|Stereo Quad Buffer]]: Switches to quad buffer stereo view. Not available in {{VersionPlus|26.3}}.

* [[Image:Std_ViewIvStereoInterleavedRows.svg|32px]] [[Std_ViewIvStereoInterleavedRows|Stereo Interleaved Rows]]: Switches to interleaved rows stereo view. Not available in {{VersionPlus|26.3}}.

* [[Image:Std_ViewIvStereoInterleavedColumns.svg|32px]] [[Std_ViewIvStereoInterleavedColumns|Stereo Interleaved Columns]]: Switches to interleaved columns stereo view. Not available in {{VersionPlus|26.3}}.

* [[Image:Std_ViewIvStereoOff.svg|32px]] [[Std_ViewIvStereoOff|Stereo Off]]: Switches stereo view off. Not available in {{VersionPlus|26.3}}.


